cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WorldDataComparison in academic or analytical work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: WorldDataComparison
abstract: >-
  An offline desktop application for comparing the latest available statistics
  of 197 countries, computing all pairwise correlations with robustness and
  confounder controls, and comparing economic, military, geographic, income,
  political and cultural country groups.
authors:
  - name: "WorldDataComparison contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - country statistics
  - international comparison
  - correlation analysis
  - data visualization
  - PySide6
  - reproducible research
  - World Bank
  - IMF
  - Our World in Data
